 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "再看另一半：签名。",
   "spoken": "再看另一半：签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.412
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "很多操作不在链上发起，而是在链下签名，再交给合约验证。",
   "spoken": "很多操作不在链上发起，而是在链下签名，再交给合约验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.46,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 4.558,
   "speechEnd": 9.189
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "免 gas 授权 permit、元交易、订单簿挂单、跨链桥验证者签名、空投领取凭证，都是这样。",
   "spoken": "免 gas 授权 permit、元交易、订单簿挂单、跨链桥验证者签名、空投领取凭证，都是这样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.248,
   "dur": 8.736,
   "speechStart": 10.346,
   "speechEnd": 18.143
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "问题是，一份签名，能被用几次？",
   "spoken": "问题是，一份签名，能被用几次？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.204,
   "dur": 4.296,
   "speechStart": 19.302,
   "speechEnd": 22.671
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "打个比方。你签了一张支付 100 元的支票。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。你签了一张支付 100 元的支票。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.0,
   "dur": 4.152,
   "speechStart": 24.098,
   "speechEnd": 27.298
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "没写日期，没写收款银行，没写支票编号。",
   "spoken": "没写日期，没写收款银航，没写支票编号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.372,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 28.47,
   "speechEnd": 32.089
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "拿到它的人，可以复印很多份，去每一家银行各兑一次。",
   "spoken": "拿到它的人，可以复印很多份，去每一家银航各兑一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.152,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 33.25,
   "speechEnd": 37.131
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "比喻在这里不完全成立：银行会自己记下兑过的支票。合约不会，除非代码让它记。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不完全成立：银航会自己记下兑过的支票。合约不会，除非代码让它记。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.196,
   "dur": 7.416,
   "speechStart": 38.294,
   "speechEnd": 44.779
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "一份安全的签名，要绑定五个字段。",
   "spoken": "一份安全的签名，要绑定五个字段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 45.832,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 45.93,
   "speechEnd": 48.572
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第一，nonce，一次性编号。缺了它，同一份签名可以在同一个合约反复提交。",
   "spoken": "第一，nonce，一次性编号。缺了它，同一份签名可以在同一个合约反复提交。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 49.628,
   "dur": 7.488,
   "speechStart": 49.726,
   "speechEnd": 56.271
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "第二，链 ID。缺了它，签名在分叉链和多链部署上同样有效。",
   "spoken": "第二，链 ID。缺了它，签名在分岔链和多链部署上同样有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 57.336,
   "dur": 6.936,
   "speechStart": 57.434,
   "speechEnd": 63.431
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "第三，合约地址。缺了它，同一份代码部署两次，签名在两个合约都有效。",
   "spoken": "第三，合约地址。缺了它，同一份代码部署两次，签名在两个合约都有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 64.492,
   "dur": 7.536,
   "speechStart": 64.59,
   "speechEnd": 71.194
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "第四，截止时间。缺了它，签名永久有效。你改主意以后，它照样能被使用。",
   "spoken": "第四，截止时间。缺了它，签名永久有效。你改主意以后，它照样能被使用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 72.248,
   "dur": 8.376,
   "speechStart": 72.346,
   "speechEnd": 79.784
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "第五，函数意图，也就是类型哈希。缺了它，给 A 函数签的数据，会被拿去调用 B 函数。",
   "spoken": "第五，函数意图，也就是类型哈希。缺了它，给 A 函数签的数据，会被拿去掉用 B 函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 80.844,
   "dur": 8.808,
   "speechStart": 80.942,
   "speechEnd": 88.808
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 89.872,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 89.97,
   "speechEnd": 91.124
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "一张领取凭证，绑定了 nonce，没有绑定链 ID。",
   "spoken": "一张领取凭证，绑定了 nonce，没有绑定链 ID。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 92.18,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 92.278,
   "speechEnd": 95.885
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "同一份合约，用相同的地址，部署在以太坊和 BNB Chain。",
   "spoken": "同一份合约，用相同的地址，部署在以太坊和 BNB Chain。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 96.936,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 97.034,
   "speechEnd": 101.391
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "凭证在以太坊用过之后，还能在 BNB Chain 领取吗？",
   "spoken": "凭证在以太坊用过之后，还能在 BNB Chain 领取吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 102.46,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 102.558,
   "speechEnd": 106.403
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "能。两条链上的 nonce 各自计数，BNB Chain 上还是 0。",
   "spoken": "能。两条链上的 nonce 各自计数，BNB Chain 上还是 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 107.712,
   "dur": 5.904,
   "speechStart": 107.81,
   "speechEnd": 112.783
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "摘要里没有链 ID，两条链算出的摘要完全相同。",
   "spoken": "摘要里没有链 ID，两条链算出的摘要完全相同。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
   "start": 113.836,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 113.934,
   "speechEnd": 118.374
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "解决办法是 EIP-712。",
   "spoken": "解决办法是 EIP-712。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-20.mp3",
   "start": 119.432,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 119.53,
   "speechEnd": 122.018
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "它把名称、版本、链 ID、合约地址，合成一个域分隔符。",
   "spoken": "它把名称、版本、链 ID、合约地址，合成一个域分隔符。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-21.mp3",
   "start": 123.06,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 123.158,
   "speechEnd": 128.015
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "再把消息的结构，合成类型哈希。",
   "spoken": "再把消息的结构，合成类型哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg4-22.mp3",
   "start": 129.088,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 129.186,
   "speechEnd": 131.721
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "用对 EIP-712，后四个字段一次解决。nonce 还要合约自己维护，每用一次，加一。",
